##vanilla_rag.py 
use model API as embeding serve, but as Deepseek has no embedding model. can't work
can choose other model if we like.

Finally, I choose to use hugging face sentence transformer

##langgraph_hf_rage.py
use hugging face local model as embedding.
pip install langchain-huggingface sentence-transformers
This can work for ingesting documents, processing into embedding vectors.

##langgraph_router_rag.py
 有错误，因为deepseek 不支持openai的json schema response
openai.BadRequestError: Error code: 400 - {'error': {'message': 'This response_format type is unavailable now', 'type': 'invalid_request_error', 'param': None, 'code': 'invalid_request_error'}}

##langgraph_router_rag2.py
fix json issue by using pydantic output parser. PydanticOutputParser